        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abia ka lweny i kom jo Babilon,” man lok pa Rwot me mony, “abimiyo nyiu dano rwenyo woko ki i Babilon, jo mo pe bidoŋ iye, kadi litino matino nyo likwayo,” Rwot ma owaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abimiyo coo leyo lobogi, dok bene ka ma pii poŋ gurre iye bibedo pol ata, abiyweyo woko maleŋ calo dako ma oyweyo ode maleŋ kun pe oweko gin mo iye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
